=== 3. Planted: detection as a function of effect size ===
Shift every threshold of item 5 (5 Appetite change) in group B by the stated number
of logits, on top of a real 0.19 SD latent difference. Everything else is
invariant by construction. Shift 0 is the null row and must reproduce
section 2. Sweeping the magnitude is the point: one convenient size would
say only that the procedure is not blind.

